Comment: 0,1:42:47.34,1:42:49.10,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}無{\k7}論{\k7}形{\k7}態{\k7}如{\k7}何
Comment: 0,1:42:49.10,1:42:50.85,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}無{\k7}論{\k7}位{\k7}於{\k7}哪{\k7}種{\k7}時{\k7}代
Comment: 0,1:42:50.89,1:42:52.02,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}一{\k7}定{\k7}要{\k7}找{\k7}出{\k7}來
Comment: 0,1:42:52.02,1:42:53.73,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}那{\k7}麼{\k7}你{\k7}要{\k7}反{\k7}抗{\k7}嗎
Comment: 0,1:42:53.64,1:43:00.02,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}那{\k7}懸{\k7}於{\k7}半{\k7}空{\k7}的{\k7}命{\k7}運
Comment: 0,1:43:00.94,1:43:07.24,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}我{\k7}們{\k7}相{\k7}遇{\k7}定{\k7}有{\k7}緣{\k7}由
Comment: 0,1:43:11.74,1:43:17.79,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}我{\k7}們{\k7}捕{\k7}捉{\k7}那{\k7}電{\k7}磁{\k7}波{\k7}定{\k7}有{\k7}緣{\k7}由
Comment: 0,1:43:17.83,1:43:23.30,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}相{\k7}互{\k7}吸{\k7}引{\k7}的{\k7}兩{\k7}人{\k7}將{\k7}何{\k7}去{\k7}何{\k7}從
Comment: 0,1:43:24.51,1:43:28.59,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}s{\k7}o{\k7} {\k7}為{\k7}愛{\k7}前{\k7}行{\k7}的{\k7}理{\k7}由
Comment: 0,1:43:28.68,1:43:32.26,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}只{\k7}因{\k7}你{\k7}在{\k7}此{\k7}處{\k7}陪{\k7}伴
Comment: 0,1:43:32.72,1:43:39.06,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}唯{\k7}有{\k7}我{\k7}會{\k7}守{\k7}護{\k7}著{\k7}你
Comment: 0,1:43:39.48,1:43:42.52,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}為{\k7}愛{\k7}祈{\k7}禱{\k7}的{\k7}理{\k7}由
Comment: 0,1:43:42.86,1:43:47.99,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}以{\k7}及{\k7}沒{\k7}人{\k7}會{\k7}被{\k7}傷{\k7}害
Comment: 0,1:43:48.36,1:43:53.87,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}因{\k7}你{\k7}永{\k7}遠{\k7}在{\k7}我{\k7}身{\k7}邊
Comment: 0,1:44:08.22,1:44:15.18,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}我{\k7}們{\k7}會{\k7}一{\k7}起{\k7}跨{\k7}越{\k7} {\k7}那{\k7}所{\k7}有{\k7}的{\k7}憎{\k7}恨
Comment: 0,1:44:15.39,1:44:24.32,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}把{\k7}那{\k7}虛{\k7}偽{\k7}的{\k7}正{\k7}義{\k7}全{\k7}部{\k7}抛{\k7}棄
Comment: 0,1:44:25.44,1:44:29.28,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}S{\k7}o{\k7} {\k7}為{\k7}愛{\k7}哭{\k7}泣{\k7}的{\k7}理{\k7}由
Comment: 0,1:44:29.65,1:44:32.70,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}只{\k7}因{\k7}你{\k7}在{\k7}那{\k7}彼{\k7}方
Comment: 0,1:44:32.78,1:44:43.34,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}我{\k7}們{\k7}將{\k7}永{\k7}不{\k7}分{\k7}離
Comment: 0,1:44:44.38,1:44:48.76,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}為{\k7}愛{\k7}前{\k7}行{\k7}的{\k7}理{\k7}由
Comment: 0,1:44:49.17,1:44:53.05,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}只{\k7}因{\k7}你{\k7}在{\k7}此{\k7}處{\k7}陪{\k7}伴
Comment: 0,1:44:53.35,1:44:59.73,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}唯{\k7}有{\k7}我{\k7}會{\k7}守{\k7}護{\k7}著{\k7}你
Comment: 0,1:44:59.98,1:45:03.06,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}為{\k7}了{\k7}愛{\k7}而{\k7}祈{\k7}禱
Comment: 0,1:45:03.40,1:45:08.90,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}然{\k7}後{\k7}彼{\k7}此{\k7}攙{\k7}扶{\k7}下{\k7}去
Comment: 0,1:45:09.03,1:45:12.20,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}永{\k7}遠{\k7}地
Comment: 0,1:45:12.36,1:45:23.42,ngnl zero cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k7}我{\k7}們{\k7}將{\k7}永{\k7}不{\k7}分{\k7}離
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - staff,,0,0,0,,——STAFF——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.23,0:00:02.73,ngnlzero - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社提供 請勿用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:06.73,ngnlzero - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}翻譯：大布鹿 雪梨 艾登 cz    時軸：沙沙 55   背鍋&特效：Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:09.73,ngnlzero - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}校對＆後期：cz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.07,0:00:17.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小時候 我認為世界應該是更為單純的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有贏不了的比試
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要努力就有回報
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切皆為可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:36.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界單純明晰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非勝即負 抑或是平局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:46.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更正確的一步棋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.31,0:00:47.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更優秀的戰術
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更高明的戰略
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:53.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便對手是「最強」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:56.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也只思考著如何在下一步勝過對手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.95,0:01:02.55,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無知且愚蠢的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:30.35,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.35,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾是這樣想的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.70,0:01:39.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無非就是騙孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:42.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過是個無聊的遊戲世界罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.04,0:01:46.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現實是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:50.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個世界只有混沌 不存在必然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充斥著偶然性
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:56.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不講理 不合常理
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.01,0:01:58.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連存在的意義也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:10.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:18.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:21.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(971.4,884.7)\fad(500,0)}艾爾奇亞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.01,0:02:42.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼我贏不了的說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:48.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我自負
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打出生起 玩這種遊戲只輸過一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:00.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「十條盟約」第六條
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:03.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}舉凡〈向盟約宣誓〉的打賭絕對要遵守
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:07.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可是唯一神所創造的「迪司博德」的絕對法則哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:09.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:12.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次一定會把你揍得落花流水
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你連那兩個人都贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是贏不了我的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:22.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空和白 你認識他們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.72,0:03:27.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那接下來一邊玩遊戲 一邊告訴你一些有趣的故事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作為珍貴的點心的回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:33.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這樣做 肯定是想讓我在不知不覺中分心 的說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:36.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想說的話就隨你說吧 的說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就說了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:42.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這原本可是不能訴說的神話哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.07,0:03:43.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我聽不見
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:51.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:55.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是發生在六千年以前的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:06.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}開闢天地 殺死了星球的曠日持久的大戰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:12.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有留在任何人的記憶或者記錄裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:20.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但即便如此 卻是唯有我不會忘卻的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.60,0:04:50.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是個大傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑灰的散布範圍很廣 抓緊時間
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.53,0:05:18.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.38,0:05:19.25,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}靈針盤怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:30.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為黑灰的緣故 已經變成這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能依靠五官來索敵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心應對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快過來 這傢伙真不得了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:46.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:50.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種製造的世界地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:52.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且這張還是最新版
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不僅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:59.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不僅有各種族的勢力圖 甚至還有地精種的戰略地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺 亞雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:05.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和現有的地圖進行比較和修正
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:07.59,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我來解讀戰略地圖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向遺志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:27.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精族的通訊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:34.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}融合？ 爆炸？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:39.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們究竟要把這顆星球破壞成什麼樣子才肯罷休啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:45.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}準備跑路了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:49.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亞雷 不要帶走靠精靈運作的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想死就說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:32.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺 這是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這裡去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:35.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向遺志起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:36.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們家的孩子就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:51.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉啊 里克…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食物在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:00.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來啊 妖魔種
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:43.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以前似乎曾經存在過被稱為太陽的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:47.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白色的火團在空中散發著光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:50.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天空蔚藍而又清澄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:54.59,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是古老的 宛如童話般的傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:59.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}諸神與其被造物之間掀起的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:01.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}持續至永恆的鬥爭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:04.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓大地化為焦土 灰燼遮蔽了天空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:07.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死亡的灰燼飛舞著落下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:17.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這灰燼…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:22.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能還算是一種慈悲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儂 娜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.27,0:09:49.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:52.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是儂娜的名字嗎 這個讀作儂娜嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:54.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}太狡猾了 也教教我嘛 克瓏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.15,0:09:55.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明是我先的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:57.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按順序來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:58.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:09:59.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:03.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:12.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你究竟要我們擔心到什麼地步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:21.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說 我不是一直讓你叫我姐姐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這也已經算快的了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:29.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:30.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:31.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:33.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.11,0:10:33.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:35.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:36.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:36.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}儂娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快看快看 這是我自己寫的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:40.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}吶 爸爸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個 儂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:45.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:53.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:02.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的爸爸 不會回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:08.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:12.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:14.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.75,0:11:16.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我沒有騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:17.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:20.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為 爸爸和我約定好了要回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:24.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他明明說了最終勝利的會是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:25.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}會勝利的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:29.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺為此竭盡全力去戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.29,0:11:31.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了讓大家勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣根本不是勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:34.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.45,0:11:37.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還不如讓里克去死…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:37.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:56.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們倆快去洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.96,0:11:57.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要洗衣服就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:00.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.73,0:12:02.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們真是臭死了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:16.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼為了勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.16,0:12:19.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這個可惡的偽善者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可是讓他捨棄了性命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:26.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對他說了「去死」兩個字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.92,0:12:31.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把話說明白 是你殺的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:34.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是為了讓自己再活一會兒才讓他犧牲的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:41.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}堅持這種做法究竟有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟能持續到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:49.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到為了一千零一個人而殺死九百九十九個人的時候嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要直到剩下最後一個人的時候嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟什麼時候才能結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:02.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟什麼時候才不用再受人欺凌 苟延殘喘地活下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這樣的世界誕生的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:16.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連沒有理由地死亡也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如同生存的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.61,0:13:26.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為「心」不承認這種毫無意義的死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺的死不是毫無意義
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:42.34,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藏有海量情報的森精種的宮殿遺蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是能輕易發現的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:50.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能在這種世界保持著正常這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}究竟能否被稱作正常呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:10.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:14.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 這個破壞的跡象
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是天翼種嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是巨大的建築物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:10.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是錯覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:14.25,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.22,0:15:36.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機凱種…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:39.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}檢討 整理狀況中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.03,0:15:42.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷靜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:45.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這些傢伙一定是成群行動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.29,0:15:47.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以和她共享意識的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.47,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「連結體」肯定近在咫尺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:53.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:58.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是在這裡與她為敵 就會與整個機凱種族敵對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.60,0:16:01.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:08.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哥哥我忍不住了讓我變成女人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:09.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:17.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}問題
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理解不能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解的是我 混賬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:28.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推測 符合場景的設定不夠充分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:29.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不湊巧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:34.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不是那種被你們觀察了還能興奮起來的變態
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:37.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疑問 「你們」是指誰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:41.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別裝傻 你們都是和連結體一起行動的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:45.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否定 本機已被「連結體」解除連接
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:47.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解除連接？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.49,0:16:49.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說你落單了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:50.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:53.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:59.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你這隻彷徨的機凱種找我這個人類有何貴幹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以問問嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:05.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回答 解析人類的獨有交流語言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是名為「心」的獨有語言
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:09.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「心」？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:10.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理由
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:14.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本機在調查關於「心」的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:16.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在對結果進行解析時
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:19.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發生大量邏輯錯誤 遭到廢棄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:22.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那之後 便單獨繼續觀測行動
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:23.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}觀測嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:26.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打算自己來解析「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:29.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後再連接回連結體嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:30.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}推測通過肌膚相親
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.66,0:17:37.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皮膚組織接觸的獨有語言為「心」的交流方式
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.21,0:17:40.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}與本機進行生殖行為…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:41.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:47.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代替方案 順從欲望蹂躪本機也沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:50.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然沒有「洞洞」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.49,0:17:52.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去死吧 話說居然沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典開」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.53,0:18:10.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遊戲001 國際象棋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:15.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比賽 申請進行遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}條件 如果本機獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:22.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求將本機帶回去 進行生殖行為
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.60,0:18:30.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏偏是國際象棋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機械的種族 和他們比演算的話毫無勝算吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:37.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:43.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:45.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回答
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:50.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}允許將本機帶回去 進行生殖行為
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:51.30,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪邊都一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.62,0:18:55.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無論選哪條路 都不會乖乖放我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:57.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}按你說的做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:01.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結論 實行符合條件的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.31,0:19:03.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 比賽只有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:05.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是條件…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:08.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要做一點小變動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.98,0:19:30.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抵達
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:37.15,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說 你這機動力 真的沒有使用精靈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:40.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定 如果使用精靈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:43.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能縮短至五萬五千七百八十二秒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:45.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}補充
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:48.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本機是解析體 通稱Prüfer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:51.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}性能在機凱種全體的平均值之下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是這種荒唐的種族參加了戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.20,0:19:57.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怕是世界也要被毀掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:00.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要怎麼稱呼你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:01.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:03.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說的是名字 你沒有名字嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.64,0:20:04.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:10.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}個體識別號碼 üc207號機Pr型4f57t9機
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.62,0:20:12.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那能算是名字嗎 不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:14.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再起一個更像人類的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.85,0:20:17.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提問 本機勝利所要求的條件是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:20.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在能夠解析「心」之前留在里克的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:23.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有必要隱藏身為機械的事實嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.93,0:20:25.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說過所謂的「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.10,0:20:28.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是從相互理解之中感受到的言外之意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:31.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要和我一起生活的話 只能扮成人類的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.03,0:20:34.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提問 名字可以自由設定嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.35,0:20:35.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}隨你喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回答 命名為休瓦爾扎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.80,ngnlzero - text - tips,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}註：Schwarzer為德語「黑色」之意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太長了 而且也不像是名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:44.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以駁回
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.52,0:20:48.33,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不解 自由設定被訂正了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能在進去之前把說話方式給改改嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:54.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讀取 模仿人格l610
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.49,0:20:59.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誒嘿嘿 哥哥 這樣可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:00.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}駁回
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:03.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反論 已經進行了極具邏輯性的設定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:06.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「其實我有個妹妹」什麼的設定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是哪門子邏輯才說得通
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:12.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要求 提供最符合狀況的設定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:13.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.51,0:21:15.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掩飾你的過去太麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:19.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}膽小而沉默寡言 不說多餘的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:23.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加在句首的像機械一樣的詞也不許用 如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.97,0:21:27.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:35.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是演技嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:36.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}演技？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.13,0:21:37.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:43.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同步了與提示設定一樣的人物並加以模仿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:45.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:49.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要離開我的視線範圍
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:50.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要脫掉衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:53.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個像尾巴一樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:54.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能想些辦法處理一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.85,0:21:57.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是休比的動力源
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.05,0:22:00.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}模擬精靈迴路接續神經
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:04.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真沒辦法 就說是裝飾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.55,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}聽好了 我再說一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:09.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}絕對不能讓其他人看到你那機械的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:13.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 只給里克看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.28,0:22:17.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好可愛 這孩子咋這麼可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:21.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回來時在毀滅的集落裡發現的 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:23.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難不成…是新娘？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:24.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新娘？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:25.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}聽人說話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:26.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 別害羞嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.61,0:22:29.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這個時代 一是生子二是食物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三四五都是生子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.01,0:22:32.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:33.47,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也別學
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.66,0:22:35.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這手勢是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.49,0:22:36.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.53,0:22:38.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什麼名字
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.96,0:22:39.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:42.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:44.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和里克是怎麼認識的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:46.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.13,0:22:51.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和里克接吻… 然後強行要求了生殖行為
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:56.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.91,0:22:57.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.89,0:22:58.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.25,0:23:04.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這種事… 等回來後再做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:08.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有其他更好的說法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.97,0:23:10.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好說法？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:11.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.13,0:23:16.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說回來 你就不能變成再成熟一點的樣子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.85,0:23:18.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想要誘惑我的話就更得這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.76,0:23:22.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個是里克喜歡的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.00,0:23:24.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我沒有那種嗜好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:27.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你喜歡怎樣的外表
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.43,0:23:32.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說啊 你知道喜歡是什麼意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:36.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想了解里克的「喜歡」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我應該說過心就是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有讀懂言外之意才能理解的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:47.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 來玩遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.62,0:23:48.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.55,0:23:51.15,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那時候是不得已才玩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:54.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遊戲都是無意義的 我沒時間能浪費在這上面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.54,0:23:57.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不是無意義的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:03.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是贏了休比的話 就出示里克你想要的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.85,0:24:04.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如說
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.45,0:24:09.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大戰開始的理由 將其終結的要素之類
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.12,0:24:13.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:18.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}區區人類之軀 沒興趣也沒必要知道這些
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.37,0:24:21.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要說我想要什麼的話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.52,0:24:27.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倖存的手段 僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.95,0:24:33.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這就是我帶著你的真正目的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.24,0:24:38.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機凱種所擁有的知識 數學 設計技術
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.81,0:24:41.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我贏了就把這些給我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.85,0:24:44.86,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:50.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在的行星環境
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.17,0:24:55.30,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人類還倖存著 異常
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.53,0:25:00.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使根據機械種的分析 理由也尚不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:08.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生物角度上孱弱 文明不成熟 連運用精靈都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:11.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但卻依舊存活著
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}應該是有理由的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.04,0:25:17.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有著能存活下去的因素
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.76,0:25:23.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那個因素 推測為「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:27.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想了解那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:27.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}我說
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.66,0:25:31.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.24,0:25:32.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.07,0:25:37.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}隨意地開始戰爭 不斷奪走我們的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還以為你會說些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.44,0:25:42.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 人類你們為什麼還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.68,0:25:44.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你們的「心」告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.21,0:25:49.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊 讓我來告訴你我的心情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:52.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只會奪取的機械全都一個樣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.30,0:25:56.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們全都去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.86,0:26:00.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道因為你們死了多少人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:03.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多少人被殺了 多少人…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.79,0:26:06.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還要讓我殺死多少人…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.87,0:26:10.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓里克 哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.46,0:26:18.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 休比 說了很過分的話 如此推測
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.51,0:26:27.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掌握到里克的「心」想要殺了休比
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.44,0:26:34.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要刺這裡 休比就會死
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:38.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死？不是生物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.49,0:26:44.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永久停止 無法修復 「全損」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.99,0:26:48.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想要了解里克的「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:53.25,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以如果里克的「心」想要這樣做的話
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.63,0:26:56.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就把休比殺死吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.97,0:27:06.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查頓 安東 艾爾瑪 克伊 迪路 西里斯 艾德
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.68,0:27:11.65,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}達勒爾 戴夫 拉克絲 維恩 埃里克 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.69,0:27:12.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.52,0:27:17.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}湯姆遜 辛塔 楊 扎扎 扎爾科 克萊因 哥洛
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.49,0:27:23.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皮塔 亞瑟 莫爾頓 奇米 達頓 賽洛 維治 沃利
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.59,0:27:28.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凱 薩貝奇 裡洛 波波 科頓 魯特 西格爾 夏奧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.22,0:27:33.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃爾夫 巴魯特 亞索 凱文特 貝爾 阿哈德 漢特
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:36.57,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴魯洛夫 瑪莎希 梅梅甘 卡里姆
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.76,0:27:39.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊旺
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:45.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總共四十八人 全部都是我命令他們去死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:49.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的確由於大戰死了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.96,0:27:52.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像拂去塵埃一般被殺死了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:55.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 讓他們去死的人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.11,0:27:58.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此宣告他們命運的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.92,0:28:16.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:01.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.27,0:28:37.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 醒著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.57,0:28:40.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉在你累的時候打擾了 能稍微…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.99,0:28:44.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗷 告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.24,0:28:53.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你為什麼會騎在我身上 能解釋下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.62,0:28:56.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克你說讓我待在你視線範圍內
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.50,0:28:58.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是指不要離開我身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.30,0:28:59.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.22,0:29:02.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}閉上眼睛的話 能看到的範圍就不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.63,0:29:03.79,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}在玩很有趣的play呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不是play
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:07.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒關係姐姐我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.35,0:29:10.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結束後叫我 我來給小休比洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:10.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:22.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克說 不能讓他以外的人看見休比的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.06,0:29:23.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀已經調教好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.85,0:29:25.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏 求你了 住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:29.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就好說了 休比就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.78,0:29:31.95,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去把澡堂的人都打發走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:49.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.01,0:29:51.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什麼對不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:57.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加害者詢問被害者的「心」 不合理
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.02,0:30:02.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}與其說不合理 不如說是太神經大條了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.68,0:30:05.95,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比有神經傳達迴路
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.03,0:30:07.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.82,0:30:12.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過 我也太感情用事了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:15.04,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是不能做的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.29,0:30:16.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:20.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使因為憤怒發狂打了你 也不能解決任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.63,0:30:22.60,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克想打休比
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.65,0:30:24.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是說說罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.30,0:30:27.95,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 也說不準
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.76,0:30:30.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.72,0:30:34.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 來玩遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.81,0:30:43.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別帶著那種東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.23,0:30:48.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的笑 只在那個時候
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.53,0:30:50.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.20,0:30:55.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來玩遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.46,0:31:00.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想了解里克的「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.17,0:31:04.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不想傷害里克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.92,0:31:08.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.43,0:31:12.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼不想傷害我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.01,0:31:14.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果想回連結體的話
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.10,0:31:18.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起對我窮追不捨 還有其他能了解「心」的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.23,0:31:21.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 正確
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.48,0:31:25.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但休比不想傷害里克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.49,0:31:28.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.64,0:31:29.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你問我啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.66,0:31:33.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}解答候補 列舉
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.95,0:31:39.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連結體無所謂 無意義 沒關係 拒絕同步 解析優先
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.12,0:31:41.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想了解里克的「心」 只要里克在就好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.87,0:31:45.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}error…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.90,0:31:47.12,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:55.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結論 好像 不想回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:31:56.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.27,0:32:03.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根據不能特定 但是 好像是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:08.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是曖昧的說法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.07,0:32:11.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兵 前進到E4
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.83,0:32:13.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少讓我先手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.03,0:32:15.50,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}輪到里克了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.57,0:32:19.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我還在幫你洗頭髮 不公平吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.74,0:32:22.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 為啥這麼長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.87,0:32:25.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}短髮比較好的話 就剪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.57,0:32:26.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不用剪啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.92,0:32:30.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是讓人難以捉摸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.58,0:33:07.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:12.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小型望遠鏡設計成功
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.09,0:33:14.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.38,0:33:16.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可沒贏過你象棋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.05,0:33:19.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我覺得里克你會想要這個
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.98,0:33:25.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和里克遇見的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.02,0:33:30.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 雖然在意那裡不自然的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是太遠了 人類是無法頻繁出入那裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:39.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到達
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:46.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還真是便利的機器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.58,0:33:51.42,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發現了嗎 雖然周圍的建築物全被破壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.63,0:33:54.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但這片地面卻不知為何沒有受到損害
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.30,0:33:58.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森精種的防禦魔法的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.30,0:34:02.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他地方都是損毀狀態 為什麼只有這裡完好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.10,0:34:09.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對森精種很重要的避難設施 保護設施
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.77,0:34:13.85,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者 有著在此之上的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.49,0:34:21.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新兵器的研究 開發設施
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:30.68,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.13,0:34:34.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}神靈種凱那斯的 加護刻印
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:37.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凱那斯 森精種的創造者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.09,0:34:40.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是加護刻印
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.80,0:34:45.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和資料庫里森精種使用的刻印 術式完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.27,0:34:49.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又製造了些什麼新的胡來的東西了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.40,0:34:53.07,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森精種那群東西 淨會熱衷於破壞星球的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.32,0:34:59.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虛空第零加護·理論驗證試驗爐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.41,0:35:02.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克能看懂森精語嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.91,0:35:07.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}辛苦拿到手的情報卻讀不懂的話就沒有價值了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.66,0:35:12.13,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通過口傳或筆記等一切能想到的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:16.16,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將其他種族的性質 語言 甚至是習慣連綿不斷傳至今日
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.80,0:35:22.47,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人類也不只是一味地被殺而已
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:27.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然這麼說 除此之外就完全看不懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.56,0:35:31.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特別是這裡 是名字嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.02,0:35:34.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是森精種的機密情報的話
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.82,0:35:38.11,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被暗號化的可能性很高
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.28,0:35:39.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.40,0:35:44.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}問題在於連相關人員的名字都得用暗號寫這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.83,0:35:47.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虛空第零加護
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.66,0:35:52.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定不是什麼好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.05,0:35:58.09,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 後退
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.57,0:36:01.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典開 通行規制」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.52,0:36:08.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.27,0:36:15.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.32,0:36:19.28,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.71,0:36:26.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.37,0:36:28.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.77,0:36:50.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.77,0:36:52.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.73,0:36:59.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.19,0:37:06.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安全系統 森精種的術式還運轉著
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:09.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.08,0:37:12.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典開 偽典 森空囁」
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:22.89,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剛才的是？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.92,0:37:29.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機凱種的特性 能將受到的攻擊解析 模仿 再現 複製
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.43,0:37:33.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然身為解析體Prüfer的休比
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.39,0:37:36.46,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能再現攻擊的一成不到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.56,0:37:41.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算這樣你也夠胡來的了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.99,0:37:46.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.74,0:37:51.99,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比打破了約定 使用了精靈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.12,0:37:55.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比起死在那裡好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.92,0:38:00.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在被怪物們探知之前 趕緊撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.30,0:38:08.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡 黑灰暴風雨嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:10.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.68,0:38:14.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有能夠去除黑灰汙染的除染液
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.27,0:38:16.98,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你沒問題但我有
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.53,0:38:27.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你帶國際象棋過來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.45,0:38:28.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.95,0:38:32.87,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我沒在怪你啦 來玩遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.79,0:38:34.66,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:39.38,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虧得這場暴風雨 我們也不會被其他種族探知到
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.71,0:38:41.59,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正好拿來打發時間
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.84,0:38:51.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡 又輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.89,0:38:52.81,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再來一回
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.39,0:38:57.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克為什麼明明贏不了還要繼續比試呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.27,0:38:58.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贏不了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.94,0:39:02.56,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克一次都沒有贏過
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.44,0:39:06.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剛才逼得你思考了很久吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.90,0:39:09.49,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰說絕對贏不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.45,0:39:16.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 有點明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.16,0:39:22.58,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在的行星環境 對人類來說是致命的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.92,0:39:25.21,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能夠存活下來 異常
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:29.88,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這種異常 訂正 偉業
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.22,0:39:32.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將其變為可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:35.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是里克的「心」 意志
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.73,0:39:43.90,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此 人類 能存活下來 是客觀事實
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.86,0:39:48.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是里克你 卻並不接受
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.57,0:39:52.74,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想認同自己 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.20,0:40:01.96,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我問你 在這種世界苟延殘喘下去有什麼意義
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.08,0:40:07.00,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不斷地逃跑延命 在這之後又能怎樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.21,0:40:09.05,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底要怎麼做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.21,0:40:12.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要閉嘴像灰塵一樣消散就好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.43,0:40:14.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不願意這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.20,0:40:17.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了一千零一個人而對九百九十九個人見死不救
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.30,0:40:19.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣世界就會改變嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.35,0:40:21.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:28.71,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告訴我啊休比 到底要怎麼做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.23,0:40:33.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到底要怎麼做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.67,0:40:39.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道這個
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.27,0:40:43.93,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的「心」是怎麼回答的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.30,0:40:49.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你面前露出這麼不像話的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是不知道才問你的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.63,0:40:55.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不帶這樣的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.55,0:40:58.76,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克想怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.64,0:41:02.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想怎麼做？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.73,0:41:08.44,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管答案是什麼 休比都會幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.23,0:41:11.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到了解里克的「心」為止
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.74,0:41:13.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比都會陪在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.11,0:41:18.43,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你身邊見證 你的「心」想怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.54,0:41:20.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:24.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比想做里克想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.63,0:41:36.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將死
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.47,0:41:42.31,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 這裡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.47,0:41:44.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少應該是平手的場景才對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.77,0:41:45.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就氣氛上來說
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.77,0:41:45.73,ngnlzero - text - tips2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(897.6,979.2)}空氣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.81,0:41:49.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大氣狀況怎麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.69,0:41:55.03,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.46,0:42:06.83,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好美
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.71,0:42:14.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 不孑然一身 也不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.88,0:42:19.01,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克一直都不是孤身一人哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.14,0:42:24.19,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我一直都像個笨蛋一樣在逞強裝帥罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.60,0:42:25.54,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.56,0:42:32.55,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是單純的遵從自己的願望行動也挺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.03,0:42:44.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 告訴我這場大戰的目的和結束條件
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.12,0:42:52.37,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小時候 我認為世界應該是更為單純的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.80,0:42:55.24,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有贏不了的比試
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.63,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要努力就有回報
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.36,0:42:59.91,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切皆為可能
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.63,0:43:03.45,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界單純明晰
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.22,0:43:07.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非勝即負 抑或是平局
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.02,0:43:11.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用天真無邪的目光看著這個世界的孩子曾想過
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:17.84,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是無知且愚蠢的孩子曾想過的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.99,0:43:20.02,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.84,0:43:25.69,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.54,0:43:32.22,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和休比在一起的話 感覺在這個世界也能做些有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.48,0:43:37.82,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 就是那個 休比覺得那個眼神好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.17,0:43:39.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼神好？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.90,0:43:41.26,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.72,0:43:49.64,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比喜歡那個眼神 應該是？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.48,0:43:56.77,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還真是曖昧的說法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.89,0:44:27.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.73,0:44:32.10,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冷靜點 往西邊出口跑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.27,0:44:33.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儂娜 跟大家一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.60,0:44:35.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.73,0:44:41.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.07,0:44:46.70,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.95,0:44:52.20,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡 這裡也要灰飛煙滅了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.45,0:44:58.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今為止 至今為止我到底是為了什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.26,0:45:02.51,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 稍微休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.72,0:45:06.17,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以後就由姐姐來接手
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.35,0:45:10.78,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 證詞錄好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.75,0:45:12.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.48,0:45:15.94,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以克瓏
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.31,0:45:18.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從今天開始 集落的長老就是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.40,0:45:21.15,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是新集落的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:23.40,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從西邊的避難路線走很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.70,0:45:25.41,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼之後就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.61,0:45:29.53,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等啊里克 沒有你在的話我和集落都會…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.58,0:45:31.97,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 克瓏在的話就沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.08,0:45:36.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為從今往後我不會再讓任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.88,0:45:39.75,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.26,0:45:53.52,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶 你們倆打算開始幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:55.06,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遊戲而已
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.02,0:46:00.36,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是要開始孩童的玩樂罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.31,0:46:03.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這裡的各位 全都沒來得及避難
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.09,0:46:06.29,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和集落一起殞命了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.28,0:46:11.18,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是已不存在於世界上的「幽靈」
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.40,0:46:15.32,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總有一天會迎來停戰
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.81,0:46:18.48,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已經不想等待這種不會到來的未來了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.50,0:46:23.23,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這種混賬世界裡苟延殘喘
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.52,0:46:24.92,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後只是祈禱戰爭結束嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.46,0:46:29.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向誰祈禱？向那些自稱神的破壞者們嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.07,0:46:32.39,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天翼種的創造者阿爾特休
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.73,0:46:35.08,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森精種的創造者凱那斯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.41,0:46:38.14,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種的創造者歐肯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.60,0:46:42.67,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那群傢伙為了證明自己才是這世界的唯一神
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.76,0:46:46.72,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不斷爭鬥著 圍繞著唯一神的寶座連帶世界也一起破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.08,0:46:49.62,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們到底要向這些混賬東西祈求些什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.76,0:46:56.80,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多該承認了吧 在這個世界根本不存在希望
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.26,0:47:01.61,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 只能用我們的手來創造
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.20,0:47:05.73,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個世界果然還是單純的「遊戲」
Comment: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:03.27,ngnlzero - text,NTP,0,0,0,,——50:00——
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.30,0:47:09.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些破壞者們只是為了占有「星杯」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.89,0:47:14.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}擁有這個世界絕對支配權的「概念裝置」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.47,0:47:17.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而沉迷於沒有規則的無聊的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.52,0:47:22.48,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我們就創造出我們想要的規則就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.61,0:47:24.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後獲勝
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.90,0:47:29.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第一】不能殺死任何人」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.92,0:47:32.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為內心不想殺死任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.16,0:47:35.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第二】不允許讓任何人死去」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.41,0:47:37.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為內心不想有任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.75,0:47:40.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第三】不能被任何人看穿」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.70,0:47:42.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為被看穿就意味著死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.48,0:47:45.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第四】任何手段都是正當的」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.78,0:47:47.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為只要不被看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.20,0:47:49.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何作弊就不能叫做作弊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:47:52.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第五】他們的規則和我們沒有任何關係」
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.89,0:47:55.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為內心不認同互相殘殺
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.18,0:47:59.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「【第六】違反以上規則的情況一律視為敗北」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.22,0:48:04.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為內心覺得違反這些規則的勝利 沒有價值可言
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.11,0:48:08.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以上 就是「想要的規則」
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.86,0:48:11.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們是幽靈
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.76,0:48:14.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包括神靈種在內的全種族
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.76,0:48:16.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}絕不能殺死任何一人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.61,0:48:18.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也絕不能被任何人看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.29,0:48:22.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要做的只有引導戰局 終結這場戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.58,0:48:27.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大戰的終結 那就是我們的勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.00,0:48:31.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敵人是神 擁有毀天滅地的暴力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.39,0:48:32.48,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人絕望的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.68,0:48:34.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勝算如塵埃般微小
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.10,0:48:38.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為達成勝利條件的前提為在暗中行動
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.52,0:48:41.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以就算獲勝也不會留在任何人的記憶和記錄中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.94,0:48:44.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為我們是幽靈 而幽靈並不會訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.65,0:48:49.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 如果
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.15,0:48:55.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果能完成這個遊戲 獲勝的話
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.41,0:48:59.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們就可以想著我們曾經最棒最帥氣地活過
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.00,0:49:02.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後昂首挺胸地死去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.54,0:49:10.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 想開始那種遊戲的人就留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.22,0:49:19.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就直說了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.64,0:49:23.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我還以為你們會更聰明一些的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.10,0:49:27.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂喂 第一步就預料錯了這還是饒了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.51,0:49:31.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克你啊 覺得這個世界上還有聰明人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.46,0:49:33.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比這個世界更加瘋狂的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.24,0:49:34.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事到如今還能找得到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.32,0:49:37.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}賢者在這個世界會選擇死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.45,0:49:40.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而更聰明的賢者則會選擇不出生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.08,0:49:44.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這裡的人 都是選擇相信里克你的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.17,0:49:49.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這不就像是愚者代表選拔麼
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.88,0:49:54.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人是愚蠢的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.42,0:49:55.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因為愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.97,0:49:57.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了不被那份愚蠢所殺害
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.97,0:49:59.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才會磨鍊自己的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:01.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在這個沒有生存價值的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.85,0:50:03.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}依然活了下來
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.89,0:50:08.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了活下來而賭上所有才智 智慧 技術的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.15,0:50:10.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若不是自命不凡的愚者
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.07,0:50:13.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值得尊敬的弱者又會是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.90,0:50:19.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來大幹一場吧 向我們同胞的遺志起誓
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.28,0:50:21.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向遺志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.99,0:50:27.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我們是以贊同的規則起誓而行動的而不是亡者的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.16,0:50:29.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.96,0:50:32.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向同樣的意志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.30,0:50:39.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 來開始遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.61,0:50:50.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 休比果然不理解「心」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.40,0:50:56.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作戰的成功率 不管哪個環節都不夠百分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.65,0:50:59.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是大家都覺得肯定會成功嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.45,0:51:02.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我問你 休比
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.89,0:51:04.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投骰子投出六的概率是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.65,0:51:07.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.21,0:51:10.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼如果有並不存在的誰
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.81,0:51:13.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把骰子換成只能投出六的骰子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.63,0:51:17.22,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(806.4,974.4)}戰況
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.63,0:51:17.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對變數進行人為操作
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.30,0:51:18.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.30,0:51:21.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這就是作弊 很有趣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.26,0:51:24.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們就是計算中的特異點
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.14,0:51:30.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引導所有的設想 戰略 計算往我們所期待的方向發展
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.98,0:51:32.32,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.52,0:51:33.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.32,0:51:38.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發生了的話 概率論就只是牽強附會而已
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.58,0:51:44.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對 所有都會被動搖 概率論裡也沒有零與一百
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.20,0:51:47.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過是紙上談兵罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.83,0:51:49.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要我證明給你看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.00,0:51:54.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提問 我現在在這裡向休比告白的概率是多少
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.96,0:51:59.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不清楚問題的意圖 粗算大概為零
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.72,0:52:01.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看吧 算錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.85,0:52:09.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請和我結婚吧 休比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.94,0:52:19.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.65,0:52:20.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.95,0:52:24.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常抱歉 明明是個處男真是十分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.95,0:52:26.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.37,0:52:31.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人類在繁殖的時候所締結的契約
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.37,0:52:34.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比是機凱種
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.00,0:52:35.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那種事情我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.54,0:52:39.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是想一直和休比在一起而已
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.67,0:52:42.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為何 現在我就在你身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.80,0:52:44.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不是這個意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.05,0:52:45.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是想你作為我人生的伴侶
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.10,0:52:49.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機凱種不能繁殖
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.26,0:52:50.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.43,0:52:52.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能進行繁殖行為
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.73,0:52:54.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克就一生都是處男
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:52:57.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也沒有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.15,0:52:58.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猶豫了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.07,0:53:00.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要在意這些細節
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.28,0:53:03.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.45,0:53:05.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.87,0:53:07.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.28,0:53:10.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為里克的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.62,0:53:14.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}轉告
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.58,0:53:16.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由「解析體」到「全連結指揮體」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.21,0:53:16.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}裁決
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.17,0:53:19.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把里克故鄉毀滅的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.38,0:53:24.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}典開 Org.2807「通行規則」
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.65,0:53:38.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是休比
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.28,0:53:51.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使如此 里克也能說出同樣的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.75,0:53:55.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 其實我早就注意到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.29,0:53:57.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也只是隱隱約約而已
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.34,0:54:01.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.63,0:54:08.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最初覺得有違和的是 第一次我們見面的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.22,0:54:12.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為什麼選擇的遊戲是國際象棋這一點
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.43,0:54:19.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且又為什麼會在離村落那麼遠的地方埋伏呢之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.02,0:54:22.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你還真是意外地不小心呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.65,0:54:24.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明明知道 但又為什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.90,0:54:31.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可能是在明知這一切的情況下還是喜歡上了休比吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.54,0:54:35.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比毀滅了我的故鄉這一過去並不能改變
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.29,0:54:40.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要是否定了這一點的話 我們就不會相遇了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.17,0:54:44.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結果就是結果 扭曲也沒有用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.63,0:54:48.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}咬牙切齒地懊悔 哭喊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.59,0:54:51.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次 下次會向前邁進
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.51,0:54:55.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以休比才會對我感興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.35,0:54:57.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.98,0:55:02.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我對休比的過去 在我旁邊的現在
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.82,0:55:04.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及從現在開始想與你在一起的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.44,0:55:07.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都深愛著
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.32,0:55:11.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我們兩個在一起 就算是這種世界我也想活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.62,0:55:16.62,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我們兩個在一起 我就能一直笑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.08,0:55:21.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以能無視一切道理
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.34,0:55:24.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我攜手同行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.84,0:55:27.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作為我的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.97,0:55:34.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.48,0:55:41.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}字面上的意思 正如你所看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.48,0:55:45.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小女不才
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.53,0:55:54.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但請讓我一直留在你身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.62,0:55:59.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.17,0:56:07.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丈夫里克 請問你是否願意娶休比為妻
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.26,0:56:12.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並發誓與她攜手同行 支持她 愛她 與她一起活下來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.30,0:56:13.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我發誓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.47,0:56:16.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的里克 這裡應該用「向遺志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.43,0:56:18.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 那個已經取消了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.52,0:56:20.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以應該用向「向同樣的意志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.56,0:56:25.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我不知道的地方幹了各種各樣的事情還真是讓人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.23,0:56:26.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說你這是什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.56,0:56:28.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑到不知道哪裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.14,0:56:31.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一但跳出來 什麼前兆都沒有就突然說要結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.96,0:56:34.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}說要舉行儀式的是克瓏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.50,0:56:35.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}話說悄悄話也太多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.99,0:56:39.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妻子休比 願意以里克為丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.91,0:56:42.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發誓與他攜手同行 支持他 愛他
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.12,0:56:42.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我發誓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.46,0:56:49.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向給予了休比的存在與出生意義以及心的里克發誓
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.59,0:56:51.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}絕對不會讓里克死去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.47,0:56:54.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓他活下來直到最後也與他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.80,0:56:55.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「向同樣的意志起誓」
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:04.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}總之作為姐姐 恭喜弟弟結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.78,0:57:05.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別 克瓏
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.37,0:57:15.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.17,0:57:16.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏 為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.95,0:57:20.54,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為這是里克所選的新娘 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.45,0:57:24.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 最後把名字刻在這個上面
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.58,0:57:26.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刻在這個石頭上？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.09,0:57:31.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}畢竟你們在明面上是不存在的 所以是不會被記載的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.71,0:57:32.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.17,0:57:34.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯 我的姓氏
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.80,0:57:37.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以後就是我們三人的姓氏了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.06,0:57:43.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們的姓氏還真拗口啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.39,0:57:47.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 休比
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.36,0:57:52.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們兩人 大家要做什麼我並不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.69,0:57:55.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們兩人已經不存在於這個世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.32,0:57:59.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.95,0:58:02.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有很重要的弟弟和可愛的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.29,0:58:05.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.29,0:58:08.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已經不想失去家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.63,0:58:11.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要太亂來
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.80,0:58:14.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不有任何人死也不會讓任何人死
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.97,0:58:17.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有這個遊戲我絕對會贏
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.05,0:58:20.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交給我們吧 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.36,0:58:35.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這氣味 是靈骸
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.99,0:58:38.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不愧是獸人種
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.28,0:58:43.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃了我也無所謂 但是味道我可不敢保證
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.83,0:58:45.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.37,0:58:50.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們作為據點的露西亞大陸西側的海灣
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.92,0:58:53.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種在進行起爆實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.67,0:58:56.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是連神靈種都能殺死的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.72,0:58:59.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被稱為「髓爆」的大規模破壞兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.47,0:59:03.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們是血壞個體對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.64,0:59:07.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}應該能想辦法潛入地精種的設施
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.02,0:59:11.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}隨便你們怎麼處理
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.61,0:59:16.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種的艦隊 警戒著獸人種進行移動
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.70,0:59:21.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}獸人種害怕「髓爆」而開始離開露西亞大陸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.53,0:59:26.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接著將森精種的機密情報透露給地精種
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.00,0:59:27.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.37,0:59:31.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最後工作就是這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.63,0:59:36.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.54,0:59:41.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣吧 請讓我以幽靈自稱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.18,0:59:46.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然擅自闖進來 肯定會有相應的緊要事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.77,0:59:50.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和你玩個簡單的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.69,0:59:51.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遊戲？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.85,0:59:54.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雙方的籌碼是情報
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.11,0:59:56.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我贏了你就提供給我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.90,0:59:58.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}輸了就反過來提供給你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.82,1:00:01.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道從哪裡來的誰
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.95,1:00:05.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然覺得能和我妮娜·克萊布比試？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.62,1:00:07.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼先給你一個情報吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.95,1:00:10.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種已經知道了「虛空第零加護」的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.33,1:00:12.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之類的如何
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.58,1:00:16.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作為「虛空第零加護」理論倡導者的你的話
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.00,1:00:23.05,ngnlzero - hm,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.4,864)}妮娜·克萊布
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.88,1:00:20.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全可以用自己的方法來驗證這個情報的真偽
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.01,1:00:22.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.26,1:00:28.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 不管你是誰
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.52,1:00:30.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看來不能放著你不管呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.64,1:00:34.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼我這邊的籌碼是「虛空第零加護」理論倡導者…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.95,1:00:38.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並不是你 這一情報我已經掌握了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.28,1:00:42.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後上述所說的是謊言的情報
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.32,1:00:47.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有你想用魔法讓我相信這一謊言的情報
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.16,1:00:54.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼 我這邊的籌碼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.92,1:00:57.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在得知「虛空第零加護」存在的前提下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.92,1:01:02.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種仍然將其判斷為不成問題的根據
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.30,1:01:04.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.80,1:01:07.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是那個難道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.14,1:01:09.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我掌握了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.14,1:01:15.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種擁有與「虛空第零加護」相比同等或更強兵器的情報
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.61,1:01:22.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「髓爆」？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.07,1:01:28.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯 能把大陸整個消滅的大規模破壞兵器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.54,1:01:33.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然能造出超越賭上森精種全部靈力的最強靈壞術式
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.37,1:01:37.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虛空第零加護」的東西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.79,1:01:39.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.84,1:01:43.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有時候是故意輸給我的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.01,1:01:46.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請讓我最後問一次
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.22,1:01:50.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是敵還是友
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.39,1:02:00.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非敵非友 只是想讓你們儘量不出現死者
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.44,1:02:03.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 幽靈先生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.45,1:02:07.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說得到這些情報之後要怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.78,1:02:09.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都隨我便對吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.33,1:02:19.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}順帶一提 妮娜·克萊布是我的假名
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.71,1:02:24.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的真名是辛克·尼爾巴連
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.88,1:02:27.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的演技你有看穿嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.43,1:02:33.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有叫過你一次妮娜嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.98,1:02:43.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然將我玩弄於手掌之上這件事我會讓你後悔的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.98,1:02:47.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}傳出森精種很黏人這種傳聞的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.07,1:02:51.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是別人 正是尼爾巴連家
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.29,1:02:58.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 里克快把除染液喝下去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.25,1:03:03.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 你騙我 你明明說了只用一個小時
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.63,1:03:06.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把這麼多黑灰塗在身上兩個小時
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.85,1:03:17.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒辦法啊 不這樣做的話
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.89,1:03:20.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一瞬間就會暴露
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.81,1:03:25.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但就算她這麼聰明
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.57,1:03:28.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也想不到我會進行這種自殺行為吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.16,1:03:32.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.36,1:03:37.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這邊好像也快不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.79,1:03:43.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我接下來大概可以活多久
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.33,1:03:46.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會讓你死的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.01,1:03:50.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克要在休比死之前活著
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.43,1:03:54.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機凱種的壽命有多長
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.89,1:03:58.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}耐用年數還有八百九十二年
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.34,1:04:03.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那還真是得加把勁呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.73,1:04:08.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣一來 第一目標
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.32,1:04:13.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把戰線排除出人類的生存圈 達成
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.24,1:04:20.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地精種之後是森精種 連獸人種都陸續離去了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.83,1:04:22.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.88,1:04:26.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莉莉 拜託你看守一會兒
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.84,1:04:28.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 克瓏
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.18,1:04:33.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幽靈的暗中活動之後也在繼續
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.97,1:04:38.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和計劃一樣 森精種和妖精種結盟
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.64,1:04:43.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}增加了和地精種的航空艦隊抗衡的龍精種的契約數
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.90,1:04:48.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一方面 地精種和關係良好的巨人種
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.73,1:04:51.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及多數的幻想種結盟
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.07,1:04:54.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被幽靈的情報所恫嚇
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.45,1:04:58.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兩個陣容互相警戒對方所持有的大規模破壞兵器
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.62,1:05:01.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將據點移至了鄰近的阿利耶拉大陸
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.25,1:05:07.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是那邊還有不可忽視的最大威脅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.13,1:05:12.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}擁有天翼種的神靈種 阿爾特休陣營
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.14,1:05:17.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「通行規則」
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.02,1:05:24.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二十三項設置完成 還剩九項
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.02,1:05:29.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在加上其他準備坐收漁翁之利的種族
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.47,1:05:33.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界正處於一觸即發的最終決戰的倒計時了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.13,1:05:37.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部都和設想一致
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.47,1:05:44.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說休比 遊戲之神存在嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.01,1:05:50.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說我見過他 你會相信嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.04,1:05:55.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那傢伙總是會下超越我預料的棋
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.95,1:05:58.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每次都輸給了他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.67,1:06:02.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是那真是非常有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.46,1:06:08.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次 下次肯定能贏 總是這樣想著
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.98,1:06:13.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我一定要和他在遊戲中做了斷
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.78,1:06:17.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為那個時候的遊戲還沒有結束
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.08,1:06:23.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克相信的話 休比也相信
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.33,1:06:30.54,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克說有就有 不會懷疑
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.00,1:06:39.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惡 剛剛那句話真想向別人炫耀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.89,1:06:40.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.93,1:06:43.47,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.01,1:06:46.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.44,1:06:54.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和里克說的一樣 沒有出現戰死者
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.28,1:06:57.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也沒有其他種族的目擊情報
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.11,1:06:58.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.91,1:07:02.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果這是里克你們做的事情的話
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.49,1:07:05.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}確實很厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.45,1:07:09.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是里克 你清楚你身體現在的情況嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.71,1:07:10.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒問題
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.42,1:07:11.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}問題大著呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.09,1:07:13.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}身體這麼破爛不堪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.55,1:07:16.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.17,1:07:18.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原諒我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.30,1:07:23.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多是指什麼時候啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.26,1:07:26.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼時候才能不讓我擔心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.36,1:07:33.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.44,1:07:37.32,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道諸神為什麼在互相爭鬥嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.95,1:07:40.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一神的寶座
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.91,1:07:42.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒錯 正如休比所說的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.12,1:07:45.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}具體來說好像是指「星杯」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.54,1:07:48.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是神靈種們
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.58,1:07:54.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了將真正的神限定為一個人而設定的「概念裝置」
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.46,1:07:55.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「概念裝置」？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.17,1:07:59.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那種東西到底在哪裡呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.38,1:08:02.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」的出現條件
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.22,1:08:07.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」會出現在這個星球最強大的力量面前
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.31,1:08:14.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在此 有十位神靈 殺掉其餘九人自己就是唯一神
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.65,1:08:17.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們就是這樣想的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.28,1:08:22.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}傻不傻啊 竟然因為這種理由把我們…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.78,1:08:25.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克瓏 說傻實在是太失禮了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.49,1:08:29.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為就算不這麼做
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.33,1:08:32.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」也會出現啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.21,1:08:36.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我才聚集那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.30,1:08:42.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虛空第零加護」「髓爆」「天擊」
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.93,1:08:47.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此強大的力量集中在這一點
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.51,1:08:50.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將這顆星球貫穿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星球？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.35,1:08:57.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的神靈種 都是從這顆星球的精靈迴路誕生的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.32,1:09:01.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是說這世上最強的力量就是
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.36,1:09:03.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精靈迴路
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.20,1:09:07.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由最弱的我們所布置的最後的舞台
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.87,1:09:09.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}借用那些傢伙的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.59,1:09:13.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將這個世界的力量平衡從根基開始一口氣打破
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.45,1:09:16.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「星杯」就會出現
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.59,1:09:19.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得到「星杯」的同時成為唯一神
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.53,1:09:21.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將星球再構成
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.51,1:09:23.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}關鍵的總攻擊的誘導
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.20,1:09:29.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由能歪曲力量指向性的休比的兵裝來實行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.22,1:09:33.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}設置「通行規則」三十二項
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.52,1:09:37.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理論上可以收集破壞這顆星球的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.90,1:09:41.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在還剩下九項 只要設置完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.28,1:09:43.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將死
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.28,1:09:47.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他們用自身的力量將星球貫穿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.03,1:09:50.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而「星杯」則由我收下從而獲勝
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.00,1:09:54.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因為沒有任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.04,1:09:57.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}結束之後還真想聽聽神明大人們會說些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.96,1:10:02.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們現在是什麼心情呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.01,1:10:03.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.30,1:10:05.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.81,1:10:13.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.40,1:10:21.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你向大家說了什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.74,1:10:25.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.57,1:10:28.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}村落肯定都發生大騷亂了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.91,1:10:32.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}別出來太久啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.33,1:10:38.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼啊 你出去的時候我可是一直都…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.04,1:10:43.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}儂娜和大家都拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.14,1:10:59.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.52,1:11:02.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行 不快點去設置「通行規則」的話
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.32,1:11:07.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒關係的 不會立刻發動攻擊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.36,1:11:09.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的預料是不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.91,1:11:10.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.20,1:11:13.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍微休息一下沒關係
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.54,1:11:17.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克的話休息一天就夠了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.42,1:11:27.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是啊 那我今天就專心地休養一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.97,1:11:34.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 拖你後腿真是抱歉啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.85,1:11:39.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 你現在快睡覺 沒有拖後腿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.15,1:11:45.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那麼休比 這是我的請求
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.78,1:11:50.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我睡覺的時候能握著你的手嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.62,1:11:57.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我會一直握著
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.62,1:12:01.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放心吧 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.13,1:12:10.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 我能遇見你真是非常感激
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.47,1:12:18.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的愛你 從今以後也是
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.32,1:12:37.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.37,1:12:42.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我馬上就回來
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.00,1:12:47.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精靈同盟的虛空第零加護
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.30,1:12:49.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}矮人同盟的髓爆
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.55,1:12:53.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無論是哪一方都是雜魚 居然想挑戰主人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.19,1:12:54.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是愚蠢至極
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.21,1:12:57.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好疼
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.81,1:12:59.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愚蠢的是你 阿茲莉爾
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.90,1:13:02.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此我們也不能輕舉妄動
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.10,1:13:07.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然阿爾特休大人要等待時機 那我們也只好靜候了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.86,1:13:11.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是無聊呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.87,1:13:20.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有八項
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.91,1:13:25.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要拿到星杯的話 里克就不會死了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.75,1:13:28.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克 等著我
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.88,1:13:29.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦呀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.38,1:13:35.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天一個人在散步嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.68,1:13:41.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發現了微量的精靈反應 就調查了一下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.60,1:13:44.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒想到竟然有意外的收穫呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.44,1:13:50.19,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}貴安 廢鐵
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:13:59.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警告
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.29,1:14:04.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果與本機敵對 將實施相應的措施
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.96,1:14:08.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就憑你一隻「解析體」嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.59,1:14:14.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已經確認半徑100km以內沒有其他機凱種反應
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.42,1:14:19.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此這可是收穫稀有度極高的頭顱的好時機呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.81,1:14:22.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 不能殺死任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.14,1:14:26.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幸好對於機凱種來說沒有死的概念
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.23,1:14:29.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二 不允許讓任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.15,1:14:32.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請不要進行無謂的抵抗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.36,1:14:32.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\an8}我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.69,1:14:33.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什麼？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:36.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本機為廢棄機體 沒有價值
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.86,1:14:40.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六 違反以上規則的情況一律視為敗北
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.58,1:14:42.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.91,1:14:45.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你…放我一馬
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.08,1:14:51.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}機凱種居然會說出求饒的話
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.05,1:14:55.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而而而且還是解除連結的缺陷品？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.42,1:14:59.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可是稀有中的稀有喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.98,1:15:04.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敵我戰力分析
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.68,1:15:07.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勝率——全無
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.73,1:15:09.90,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.23,1:15:13.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}概率論裡不存在「0」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.86,1:15:22.47,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「讀取」 代碼1673B743E1F255腳本E 啟動
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.08,1:15:23.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典開」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.41,1:15:28.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最終展開
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.42,1:15:33.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}賭上全武裝、戰力、戰術
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.59,1:15:36.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}開始求饒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.84,1:15:44.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦呀 機凱種是解析並模仿擊破要素的種族吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.06,1:15:49.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難道有哪位是被笑著殺死的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.81,1:15:51.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「制速違反」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.49,1:16:06.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「全方交叉」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.96,1:16:19.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到處散布靈骸 真是對環境不友好的機械呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.18,1:16:23.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是就憑這樣子就想把我怎麼樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.64,1:16:26.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}當然想都沒想過
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.64,1:16:31.83,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典開」——「偽典·焉龍嘯」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.28,1:16:44.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一方通行」
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.20,1:16:48.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就這樣跳躍到天翼種無法探知的範圍
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.62,1:16:50.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就這樣…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.88,1:16:51.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.54,1:16:54.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要去哪兒~
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.39,1:17:10.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 本來瞄準的是頸部來著
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.02,1:17:13.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失手了麼
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.27,1:17:20.11,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒想到機械居然會有第六感呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.65,1:17:22.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有種不好的預感
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.82,1:17:24.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要留下頭就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.20,1:17:29.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是時候讓你像廢鐵一樣埋在土裡了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.95,1:17:31.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「通行規則」
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.43,1:17:45.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.35,1:17:50.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不想死 不能死…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.18,1:17:53.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為休比的錯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.89,1:17:55.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而敗北什麼的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.49,1:18:06.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在的休比能做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.49,1:18:12.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了里克 能做的事…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.20,1:18:22.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}個體標識編號「Üc207Pr4f57t9」
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.81,1:18:24.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向「Ü連結體第一指揮體」申請再連結
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.92,1:18:26.55,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(742.133,985.333)}{\pos(760.8,972)}生命
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.92,1:18:26.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「心」的解析已經完成
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.55,1:18:28.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}請批准再連結
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.51,1:18:34.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被永久解除連結處分的貴機的資料出現重大錯誤
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.35,1:18:35.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}駁回申請
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.81,1:18:37.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拒絕駁回申請
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.52,1:18:42.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不論是如何報告的 也應該需要解析才對
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.77,1:18:44.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}申請再連結
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.69,1:18:46.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連結！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.07,1:18:50.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不… 訂正
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.50,1:18:52.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你個不講理的混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.04,1:18:58.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本來不想交給任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.58,1:19:01.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜歡里克 不想跟里克分開
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.38,1:19:03.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因為很害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.13,1:19:06.30,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(1325.333,992)}{\pos(1296,984)}心
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.13,1:19:06.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克給予我的 滿溢而出的「錯誤」
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.80,1:19:10.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全部 全部都是只屬於休比的東西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.43,1:19:12.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把那個交出來
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.26,1:19:15.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}給我明白這份含義啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.24,1:19:20.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要再說廢話了 把這份感情繼承下去啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.79,1:19:40.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然貴機已經損壞
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.11,1:19:43.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.38,1:19:47.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}矛盾、破裂 但是仍在運作 異常
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.09,1:19:49.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這我也知道
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.80,1:19:51.76,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能 不可理喻
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.87,1:19:53.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這就是現實
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.68,1:19:56.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從里克那兒得到的心表明的事實
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.64,1:19:59.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.98,1:20:02.85,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1113.6,981.6)}貴重的樣品資料
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.98,1:20:02.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}判斷貴機為「特例擔當」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.27,1:20:06.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}資料同步開始
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.19,1:20:08.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}離同步完成還有251秒
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.03,1:20:12.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}期間禁止貴機的「全損」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.24,1:20:15.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「全典開」
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:20.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「構築」對未知用戰鬥演算啟動
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.53,1:20:24.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這份思念 這顆心
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.27,1:20:31.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從機械中孕育出來 得到了生命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.43,1:20:39.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這全部 都賭在這251秒裡！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.37,1:20:46.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這巨大的翅膀 是在諷刺我嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.76,1:20:50.57,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}區區人偶 正合我意
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.95,1:20:51.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.45,1:20:53.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啥？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.16,1:20:58.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我還沒自報姓名 這就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.95,1:21:03.46,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\pos(1320.533,984.8)}{\pos(1291.2,976.8)}我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.95,1:21:03.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從里克那兒得到的 重要的「名字」
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.79,1:21:06.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.59,1:21:10.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是吉普莉爾 很高興認識你
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.29,1:21:11.40,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後……
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.22,1:21:14.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永別了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.61,1:21:24.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要跟著對方的步子走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.52,1:21:26.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}絕對不要交出主導權
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.81,1:21:28.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓對手大意吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.44,1:21:30.53,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓她以為我不足為懼
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.03,1:21:32.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓對手警惕吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.60,1:21:35.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讓她產生不能攻擊我的錯覺
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.32,1:21:39.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}現在不行的話 就寄希望於下一步
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.38,1:21:44.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能死
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.67,1:21:47.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還不能死啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.50,1:22:07.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「通行規制」
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.46,1:22:28.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}終於犯下像樣的「錯誤」了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.46,1:22:28.21,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1144.8,974.4)}打偏
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.46,1:22:30.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真讓我費了一番功夫
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.21,1:22:36.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打偏… 是指什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.36,1:22:41.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.77,1:22:44.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對剛才稱呼你為廢鐵一事進行謝罪
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.39,1:22:46.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撤回前言
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.48,1:22:51.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是需要被確實排除的威脅
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.40,1:22:54.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我判斷你為值得我拿出全力對付的敵人
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.95,1:23:02.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同步完成
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.17,1:23:08.62,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這場遊戲
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.92,1:23:12.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是休比贏了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.25,1:23:15.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「典開」—「進入禁止」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.61,1:23:31.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.82,1:23:34.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:38.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比終於明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.44,1:23:46.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比能遇到里克 真的很幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.36,1:23:52.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一次一定不要再分開了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:56.88,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的 愛著你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.97,1:24:08.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}頭顱沒拿到手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.06,1:24:10.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}零件也全都打成渣了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.74,1:24:15.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且因為過度使用力量 變成了這副樣子
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.73,1:24:21.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣子 到底有什麼好處啦……
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.42,1:24:39.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還以為這次絕對會贏
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.34,1:24:43.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和休比兩人一起 和大家一起的話…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.52,1:24:50.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然不知道哪方神聖製作了人類
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.94,1:24:53.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.73,1:24:55.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就一回而已
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.02,1:24:58.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}僅僅一回的勝利都不被允許嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.78,1:25:02.16,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣的話
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.28,1:25:08.12,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那樣的話為什麼要給予我們「心」啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.39,1:25:16.17,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.12,1:25:23.18,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克要在休比死之前活著
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.68,1:25:29.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 沒錯啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.44,1:25:36.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比死了的話 也好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.82,1:25:41.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就這樣子…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.08,1:25:52.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「意志者」 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.08,1:25:52.00,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(897.6,974.4)}Spieler
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.84,1:26:00.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是誰
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.21,1:26:02.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然我沒有名字
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.88,1:26:04.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過姑且叫我「全連結指揮體」吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.38,1:26:09.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我為實現「遺志體」休比的遺志而來
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.89,1:26:11.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.48,1:26:18.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}規則其二 不允許讓任何人死去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.19,1:26:25.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里克所定的規則 敗北條件不包括道具的損失
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.58,1:26:30.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比的損失不包含其中
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.08,1:26:36.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將軍了 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.88,1:26:40.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下來就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.76,1:26:45.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面提供其附帶情報
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.89,1:26:53.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一 目前「通行規則」設置點有多種族集結
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.81,1:26:56.85,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我們有異常動作 則會被感知
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.98,1:27:00.15,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}交戰概率有98%
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.48,1:27:04.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此能運作的「通行規則」已經全部設置完畢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.03,1:27:10.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}共計僅24項 不足以誘導貫穿星球的能量
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.41,1:27:16.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是西南方的誘導可以實現
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.37,1:27:19.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二 我們機凱種
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.79,1:27:24.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以解析受到的攻擊並展開模仿的武裝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.84,1:27:29.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藉此武裝意志者里克可以貫穿星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.18,1:27:33.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此「星杯」也能得以顯現
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.22,1:27:38.64,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們機凱種 無心的機械
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.10,1:27:40.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}僅為道具
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.98,1:27:44.48,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只會忠於命令並付諸實行
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.78,1:27:47.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 意志者里克
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.61,1:27:51.62,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們將補正你的戰略 請下令
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.58,1:27:55.91,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.37,1:28:04.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}命令 道具的損失 不視作敗北
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.96,1:28:10.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比 如果這就是你的願望
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.22,1:28:13.26,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你如此希望的話
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.22,1:28:21.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好可愛 有點討厭修復術式了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.31,1:28:24.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明明很久沒能見到這麼可愛的吉普醬
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.94,1:28:29.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}區區廢鐵 到底在打什麼算盤
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.74,1:28:34.73,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上方感知到複數熱源
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.66,1:28:36.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.37,1:28:42.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什什什 什麼事…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.17,1:28:44.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剛剛到底是誰在用天擊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.92,1:28:47.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}確認受到阿邦特·赫伊姆的先制攻擊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.71,1:28:49.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}準備發射「髓爆」
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.05,1:28:53.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虛空第零加護」全術式解放
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.93,1:28:55.39,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}右舷 目標阿爾特休
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.55,1:28:57.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}左舷 地精種艦隊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.56,1:29:00.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來自阿邦特·赫伊姆的先制攻擊？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.48,1:29:03.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不對… 這是
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.11,1:29:11.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真敢小瞧我們呢 廢鐵
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.50,1:29:29.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿爾特休大人
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.26,1:29:33.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭候多時了 吾之天敵
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.80,1:29:39.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原來如此 身為最弱卻向我這個最強者挑戰十分合理
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.20,1:29:44.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對吧 「猴子」
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.02,1:29:46.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從阿邦特·赫伊姆的背後
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.15,1:29:49.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}發射不殺死任何人的天擊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.74,1:29:51.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此一來
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.42,1:29:55.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}連結體開始向設置地點移動
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.59,1:29:58.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}馬上所有火力的衝突就要開始了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.48,1:30:02.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全員 準備
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.25,1:30:03.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對手是神靈種
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.04,1:30:08.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想必能輕易看穿區區人類的小把戲吧
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.45,1:30:12.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便如此那群傢伙也要全力將其擊潰
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.76,1:30:16.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這就是強者的概念 強者的道理
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.05,1:30:25.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}認清自己的渺小吧 只會賣弄小聰明的塵芥
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.24,1:30:27.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}擔雪塞井 以卵擊石
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.19,1:30:34.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}渺小蟲介即便群聚而上也無法觸碰天威
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.36,1:30:37.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「虛空第零加護」全術式齊展開
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.25,1:30:40.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「髓爆」全彈發射
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.20,1:30:42.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「神擊」
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.76,1:30:56.68,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便有虛空第零加護和髓爆的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.38,1:31:00.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也無法阻止阿爾特休的神擊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.68,1:31:04.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的能量相互碰撞 收束
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.60,1:31:08.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成為宣告這世界毀滅的光芒
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.61,1:31:14.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然後…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.87,1:31:28.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偏向了？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.86,1:31:35.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把這能量
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.18,1:31:40.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我們是機械 沒有內心的道具
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.01,1:31:44.67,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}無命而往 持命而逝
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.19,1:31:46.93,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「以上」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.54,1:31:48.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「明白」
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.85,1:31:59.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}投入4807連結體 成功再現設計 開始同步
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.32,1:32:09.33,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}典開 org.0000「真典·弒星者」 託付給你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:28.27,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1092,981.6)}Stalement
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.01,1:32:28.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這樣子 就是平局了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.44,1:32:32.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉啊 眾神
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.40,1:33:10.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}星杯…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.11,1:33:18.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}為了這一瞬間 有多少人死去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.31,1:33:21.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比的同伴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.48,1:33:23.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}活生生的他們
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.36,1:33:28.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底死了多少人！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.51,1:33:31.87,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至不惜欺騙自己
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.71,1:33:35.21,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至把休比的思念踩在腳下
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.80,1:33:43.63,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這 這到底算哪門子平局啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.76,1:33:51.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.98,1:33:55.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}對不起 休比
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.40,1:33:57.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又輸了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.40,1:34:04.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說休比 如果我們再度合而為一的話
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.18,1:34:08.24,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次一定要贏啊 休比
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.00,1:34:12.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不會再讓任何人死了 這種遊戲
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.04,1:34:16.28,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果神是從思念之中誕生的話
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.25,1:34:21.84,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遊戲之神
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.02,1:34:24.13,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}雖然是如塵土一般不值一提的生命
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.38,1:34:27.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這是奉獻我所有的 人生中第一次的乞求
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.91,1:34:29.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜託了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.52,1:34:34.35,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果說區區敗者 也想竊取勝利果實太骯髒的話
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.48,1:34:37.56,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果說雙手早已沾滿鮮血的話
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.06,1:34:43.44,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1000.8,969.6)}心
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.06,1:34:43.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜託了 至少告訴我 「我們」的意義在哪裡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.78,1:34:47.99,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰都可以 讓這場戰爭結束吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.73,1:34:51.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將這星杯
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.64,1:34:53.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}誰來…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.59,1:35:06.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈哈 什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.18,1:35:09.34,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然還是有的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.51,1:35:13.43,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吶 下次再來玩遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.28,1:35:16.52,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次一定會贏過你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.35,1:35:20.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和休比兩人一起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.35,1:35:22.40,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}絕對可以
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.92,1:35:39.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小時候 我認為世界應該是更為單純的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.49,1:35:42.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沒有贏不了的比試
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.64,1:35:44.71,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要努力就有回報
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.03,1:35:46.75,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切皆為可能
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.30,1:35:51.05,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用天真無邪的眼光去看世界
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.99,1:35:53.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.05,1:36:10.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}將死了呢 里克
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.33,1:36:16.66,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果一切順利的話
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.00,1:36:20.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能不能幫我把白車移動到E6呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.71,1:36:21.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.41,1:36:24.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.77,1:36:26.59,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.30,1:36:28.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接下來就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.34,1:36:32.55,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至今為止 十分感謝
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.88,1:36:36.72,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我說里克 休比
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.68,1:36:40.06,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們兩個真的做了很厲害的事哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.94,1:36:43.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完結了永遠的戰爭哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.48,1:36:45.65,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.36,1:36:51.74,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太奇怪了吧 為什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.25,1:36:57.58,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姐姐我為什麼會這麼不甘心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.83,1:37:04.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遊戲還沒結束哦
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.29,1:37:07.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是「將死」而是「將軍」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.97,1:37:11.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.26,1:37:14.89,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(962.4,974.4)}Perpetual Check
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.26,1:37:14.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陷入「長將」了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.39,1:37:20.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我打成平手還是第一次呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.65,1:37:28.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並非由誰創造
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.78,1:37:30.44,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並非有誰希冀
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.03,1:37:32.86,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並非有誰祈願
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.70,1:37:35.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}僅憑自身意志
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.66,1:37:37.70,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從野獸進化成雙足行走
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.54,1:37:41.08,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}並掌握智慧的無名種族
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.54,1:37:42.50,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人類
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.50,1:37:46.96,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要作為唯一神賜予你們名字
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.67,1:37:49.80,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(969.6,964.8)}immunity
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.67,1:37:49.80,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「人類種」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.92,1:37:51.92,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}——十條盟約——
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【一】這個世界禁止一切殺傷、戰爭與掠奪。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【二】所有的糾紛一律以遊戲勝負解決。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【三】遊戲需賭上雙方判斷對等的賭注。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【四】在不違反【三】的情況下，遊戲內容、賭注皆不限制。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【五】受挑戰方有權決定遊戲的內容。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【六】舉凡〈向盟約宣誓〉的打賭絕對要遵守。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【七】集團間的糾紛應指定全權代理人。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【八】遊戲中若有不正當行為，一旦敗露即視同敗北。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【九】以神之名宣布，以上各條皆為絕對不變的規則。
Comment: 0,1:37:57.30,1:37:57.30,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}【十】大家一起和平地玩遊戲吧！！
Comment: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:11.61,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}——
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.51,1:37:56.89,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自稱擁有知性的「十六種族」
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.27,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1015.2,984)}アシエイト
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.89,1:38:00.27,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}繼承「意志者們的公儀」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.64,1:38:03.14,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}視為「十六種族的同意」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.64,1:38:03.14,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(1015.2,991.2)}アッシエント
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.77,1:38:07.36,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以「唯一神之座」而定的「十條盟約」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.77,1:38:07.36,ngnlzero - text - tips2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\pos(732,993.6)}アシエンテ
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.07,1:38:10.78,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}從今天開始 世界改變了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.57,1:38:14.95,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}來 繼續遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.30,1:38:31.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這個故事 哪裡是說謊哪裡是真實
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.58,1:38:34.51,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這可是 把真相全部告訴你的話
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.53,1:38:36.77,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就不是「不能訴說的神話」了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.73,1:38:39.98,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然你很惹人討厭的說
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.03,1:38:44.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不過撫摸很舒服就原諒你的說
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.27,1:38:46.60,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.93,1:38:48.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱碳
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.64,1:38:52.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空 白 史蒂公
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.58,1:38:56.09,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是的 你跑哪裡去了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.12,1:38:58.94,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上可是有很多可疑的人哦
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.99,1:39:02.04,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像哥哥和白那樣的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.06,1:39:04.25,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贏了就跑什麼的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.08,1:39:07.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱 這可不行哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.44,1:39:10.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世上可是有這種怪人存在哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.55,1:39:15.22,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.80,1:39:19.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}這文字是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.83,1:39:21.01,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普莉爾
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.63,1:39:23.81,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在在在
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.14,1:39:25.10,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能看懂嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.39,1:39:29.31,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是人類種語言統一前的語言呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.35,1:39:33.03,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔細想想 不正是這傢伙的錯嗎 的說
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.39,1:39:35.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.07,1:39:36.38,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\blur3}里克·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.43,1:39:38.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比·多拉
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.53,1:39:39.82,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克洛妮·多拉？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.97,1:39:42.41,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是艾爾奇亞的建國女王
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.63,1:39:45.20,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一生中都沒人見過她哭泣
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.30,1:39:47.79,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}充滿著知性和笑容的才女
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.96,1:39:49.46,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是多拉家族的驕傲
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.78,1:39:51.29,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}還有兩位呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.88,1:39:54.42,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道… 不認識呢
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.85,1:39:59.97,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休比… 那好像不是人類來著
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.96,1:40:06.02,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊綱覺得自己認識他們的說
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.39,1:40:09.23,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.84,1:40:15.69,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界什麼的 其實是十分單純的事物
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.32,1:40:18.07,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如他感受到的一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.72,1:40:22.49,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}難得我製造出來的單純的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.49,1:40:25.37,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它弄的這麼複雜的那群人
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.71,1:40:27.45,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你們一定能將其打倒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.21,1:40:29.00,ngnlzero - text,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以…
